<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Activate shield field-->
  <VFEP.ActivateShield>激活护盾场</VFEP.ActivateShield>
  <!--EN: Click to activate the shield field. It has 10 seconds of active mode and then 90 seconds cooldown.-->
  <VFEP.ActivateShieldDesc>单击以激活屏蔽场。它有 10 秒的活动模式和 90 秒的冷却时间。</VFEP.ActivateShieldDesc>
  <!--EN: Armor frame:-->
  <VFEP.ArmorFrame>装甲框架：</VFEP.ArmorFrame>
  <!--EN: Cancel-->
  <VFEP.Cancel>取消</VFEP.Cancel>
  <!--EN: Children cannot use this.-->
  <VFEP.ChildrenCannotUseThis>儿童不能使用此功能。</VFEP.ChildrenCannotUseThis>
  <!--EN: Select Your Curses-->
  <VFEP.ChooseCurses>选择你的诅咒</VFEP.ChooseCurses>
  <!--EN: The more curses you select, the more pawns your storyteller will allow you to have, and the rarer big threat events will be.-->
  <VFEP.ChooseCurses.Desc>你选择的诅咒越多，你的说书人允许你拥有的棋子就越多，重大威胁事件就越罕见。</VFEP.ChooseCurses.Desc>
  <!--EN: Crafter:-->
  <VFEP.Crafter>工匠：</VFEP.Crafter>
  <!--EN: Days between Big Threats: {0}-->
  <VFEP.DaysBigThreats>大威胁之间的天数：{0}</VFEP.DaysBigThreats>
  <!--EN: Fire a long range spidermine that will automatically run towards the nearest enemy, detonating as soon as it reaches them.-->
  <VFEP.DeploySpidermineDesc>发射一枚远程蜘蛛地雷，它会自动跑向最近的敌人，并在到达敌人后立即引爆。</VFEP.DeploySpidermineDesc>
  <!--EN: Deploy small, combat-ready drones from the docking port in the back. These drones can be controlled to provide firing support, but will self-detonate after 60 seconds.-->
  <VFEP.DeployWarDrone>从后面的对接端口部署小型战备无人机。这些无人机可以被控制来提供火力支援，但会在 60 秒后自爆。</VFEP.DeployWarDrone>
  <!--EN: Desired population max: {0}-->
  <VFEP.DesiredPopMax>所需的最大人口数量：{0}</VFEP.DesiredPopMax>
  <!--EN: (Warning: {PAWN_nameDef} is not capable of violence, it will make {PAWN_objective} useless.)-->
  <VFEP.EntombInIncapableOfViolenceWarning>（警告：{PAWN_nameDef} 没有暴力能力，它会使 {PAWN_objective} 毫无用处。）</VFEP.EntombInIncapableOfViolenceWarning>
  <!--EN: Helmet:-->
  <VFEP.Helmet>头盔：</VFEP.Helmet>
  <!--EN: Research warcaskets to learn how to use the foundry.-->
  <VFEP.NoWarcaskets>研究战匣以了解如何使用铸造厂。</VFEP.NoWarcaskets>
  <!--EN: Not enough chemfuel for power jump.-->
  <VFEP.NotEnoughFuel>没有足够的化学燃料来进行动力跳跃。</VFEP.NotEnoughFuel>
  <!--EN: Research more warcasket technology to unlock more armor pieces.-->
  <VFEP.ResearchText>研究更多的战棺技术来解锁更多的盔甲部件。</VFEP.ResearchText>
  <!--EN: Resource Cost:-->
  <VFEP.ResourceCost>资源成本：</VFEP.ResourceCost>
  <!--EN: Shoulderpads:-->
  <VFEP.Shoulderpads>护肩：</VFEP.Shoulderpads>
  <!--EN: Siege mode off-->
  <VFEP.SiegeModeOff>攻城模式关闭</VFEP.SiegeModeOff>
  <!--EN: Siege mode on-->
  <VFEP.SiegeModeOn>攻城模式开启</VFEP.SiegeModeOn>
  <!--EN: Total Cost:-->
  <VFEP.TotalCost>总成本：</VFEP.TotalCost>
  <!--EN: Warcasket Customization-->
  <VFEP.WarcasketCustom>战棺定制</VFEP.WarcasketCustom>
  <!--EN: When you press Accept, a crafter you’ve chosen will bring the resources onto the frame and begin
assembling a warcasket. The speed of the assembly depends on the crafting skill of your crafter.
Once the process is completed, a warcasket will leave the platform. Be careful, as the pawn
on the platform can still die of hunger when on the platform - you should prioritize the warcasket
assembly over other tasks.-->
  <VFEP.WarcasketText>当您按下“接受”时，您选择的工匠会将资源带到框架上并开始
组装战棺。组装速度取决于工匠的制作技能。
组装过程完成后，战棺将离开平台。请小心，因为平台上的pawn
在平台上时仍然可能死于饥饿 - 您应该优先考虑战棺
组装而不是其他任务。</VFEP.WarcasketText>
  <!--EN: Work Amount:-->
  <VFEP.WorkAmount>工作量：</VFEP.WorkAmount>
  <!--EN: Cannot entomb in warcasket: {0}-->
  <VFEPirates.CannotEntomb>无法埋入战棺：{0}</VFEPirates.CannotEntomb>
  <!--EN: Entomb in warcasket-->
  <VFEPirates.EntombInWarcasket>埋葬于战棺中</VFEPirates.EntombInWarcasket>
